val receipt\"]\n  Receipt --> Gate{\"receipt、版本与能力匹配？\"}\n  Gate -->|是| Runtime[\"允许插件运行\"]\n  Gate -->|否| Closed[\"失败关闭并显示恢复/重新批准 CTA\"]\n```\n</details>\n\n\n<!-- greptile_other_comments_section -->\n\n<sub>Reviews (13): Last reviewed commit: [\"fix(desktop): fail fast on forge worker ...\"](https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/commit/9b380af3d95630abbab95df97e4f7b89385abfaa) | [Re-trigger Greptile](https://app.greptile.com/api/retrigger?id=50773537)</sub>","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":867647,"client_id":"Iv1.5ad00a8cea2f6701","slug":"greptile-apps","node_id":"A_kwHOCFqEf84ADT0_","owner":{"login":"greptileai","id":140149887,"node_id":"O_kgDOCFqEfw","html_url":"https://github.com/greptileai","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"Greptile Apps","description":"Greptile is an AI agent that reviews pull requests with full context of your codebase. It can catch hidden bugs, security vulnerabilities, and anti-patterns. ","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/greptile-apps","created_at":"2024-04-02T00:16:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T22:55:44Z","permissions":{"actions":"read","checks":"write","contents":"write","deployments":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","secret_scanning_alerts":"read","security_events":"read","statuses":"write","vulnerability_alerts":"read"},"events":["issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository"]},"minimized":null},{"html_url":"https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/1916#issuecomment-5204120246","id":5204120246,"node_id":"IC_kwDOTgdRUs8AAAABNjCStg","user":{"login":"MagicLizi","id":17176223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTc2MjIz","html_url":"https://github.com/MagicLizi","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-06T11:35:27Z","u